{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"塞内加尔","country_iso":"SEN","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:19:57.783555","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"SEN-HB-0004","ldc":"Yes","location":"达喀尔","location_norm":"达喀尔省","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"塞内加尔达喀尔1.5MW光伏+储能微电网项目","project_name_en":"Senegal Dakar 1.5MW PV+ESS Microgrid Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"近日，\n江西电建设与SOLEKTRA INTERNATIONAL公司在塞内加尔首都达喀尔成功签约总容量约为1.5MW光伏+储能微电网新能源项目\n。该项目是江西电建在非洲承担的首个微电网+储能光伏发电项目。\n塞内加尔的首都达喀尔，是塞内加尔的政治、经济中心，是西非地区的重要枢纽。\n该项目位于达喀尔市Diamniadio工业园内，项目由直流侧1.5MW光伏阵区配备200KW的柴油发电为主要动力能源单元供给园区办公生产，采用低压分散式接入，同时接入124KWH锂电池组用于调节电能质量。\n该项目的签约为江西电建在西非地区新能源市场打开了新局面，扩大了中国电建的品牌影响力。","content_sha256":"7359c4ad3c2976e87c22ba6bd8e2b98515ef4bc3b7ab8b4c64c7a692bd023622","id":24345,"publish_date":"2019-03-07 18:30:59","title":"江西电建签约塞内加尔微电网总承包新能源项目","title_sha256":"08dd2ef9a511116f8f2523820e3b5522fc85b04790afa41fe1bce009df3a7333","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/8902.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"SEN-HB-0004","capacity_details":"PV: 1.5MW, Diesel Generator: 200KW, BESS: 124KWH","capacity_mw":1.5,"capacity_mw_raw":"1.5","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T09:19:57.786641","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"SEN-HB-0004-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.energytrend.cn/news/20190312-65852.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"SOLEKTRA INTERNATIONAL","project_developer_en":"SOLEKTRA INTERNATIONAL","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"江西电建在塞内加尔达喀尔签约承建一个1.5MW光伏+储能微电